<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells PLN 300 mln bills, yield flat.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells PLN 300 mln bills, yield flat.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland on Friday sold 300 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after banks bid for 300 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the bills remained unchanged at 22.20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
